From aa56c503e22bb105ed67007c3044ca70a257bbb3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: local <local@example.invalid>
Date: Sun, 4 Oct 2026 00:39:17 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 04/34] STEP0: Staging deploy target in GitHub Actions

Integration (new order): the staging target can run on the real UbyPort test
environment as well as on the mock. "Deploy staging" has a ubyport_env input
(mock or test, default mock); the reusable deploy-lightsail.yml validates it,
refuses it on production, and on the staging server writes it into .env as
UBYHOST_UBYPORT_ENV after the identity check. preflight.sh accepts mock (with
the mock-ubyport profile and URL) or test on staging, never prod. README,
.env.example and DEPLOYMENT.md document the input.
