 Production Docker stack with HTTPS. **Guides:**
@@ -257,3 +258,45 @@ If the replica is unusable, fall back to the newest age-encrypted snapshot
 (`restore.sh`, or the S3/Drive off-site copy). `restore.sh` stops Litestream
